    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nThis deceptively spacious three-bedroom end-of-terrace family home comes to the market in excellent condition and benefits from a wide side passage together with a large detached garage to the rear, offering superb storage or future potential. Boasting a sunny south-facing rear garden and excellent scope to extend or further develop (subject to the necessary planning permission), this wonderful home is ideally positioned on a quiet, family-friendly road within easy walking distance of Dundrum Town Centre, Nutgrove Shopping Centre, the Luas, and an excellent selection of schools, parks and local amenities.\n\nCombining generous accommodation, an enviable location and exceptional potential, this is a home that will undoubtedly appeal to couples and growing families looking to put down roots in a well-established and convenient neighbourhood.\n\nThe well-appointed accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall, a family bathroom, and to the rear, a bright open-plan kitchen, dining and living area overlooking the rear garden.\n\nUpstairs, there is a landing, a spacious principal bedroom with en-suite, a second double bedroom, and a generous single bedroom.\n\nTo the front, the property benefits from a stone-covered driveway providing off-street parking for a number of vehicles. The south-facing rear garden features a large lawn and a patio area, creating an ideal space for outdoor dining and entertaining. As previously mentioned, the property also benefits from a substantial detached garage, offering excellent storage or the flexibility to suit a variety of uses.\n\nThe location is second to none being only minutes from a wide range of amenities including Dundrum Town Centre, Nutgrove Shopping Centre, the M50, Rathfarnham village and Marlay Park. There is also quick and easy access to the city centre with a regular bus service within a 5 min walk and the Luas is less than a 20-minute walk away. The area itself is quiet and mature and very popular with first time buyers."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nGROUND FLOOR - \n\n\nEntrance Hall - 1.51m x 3.31m\nWelcoming space with laminate flooring\n\nBathroom - 1.51m x 2.28m\nHigh quality fully tiled bathroom suite with WC, WHB and bath.\n\nKitchen/Living/Dining Room - 4.39m x 5.69m\nFully fitted kitchen area with laminate flooring. Built in electrical fire place.\n\nFIRST FLOOR - \n\n\nLanding - 0.88m x 2.10m\nStorage space to the side.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.31m x 3.19m\nBuilt in wardrobes overlooking the rear garden.\n\nEn-suite - 2.65m x 1.23m\nHigh quality tiled en-suite with WHB, WC and shower\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.68m x 4.38m\nSpacious double room facing the front room\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.33m x 2.31m\nSingle room with rear garden view.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Outstanding three-bedroom family home</li><li> South facing rear garden</li><li> No chain</li><li> Presented in excellent condition</li><li> End-of-terrace</li><li> Large Detached garage in rear garden</li><li> Double glazed Windows</li><li> GFCH</li><li> Wide side passage</li><li> Huge development potential (Subject to the relevant planning permission)</li><li> Within walking distance of excellent schools</li><li> Situated beside Nutgrove Shopping Centre and with walking distance of Dundrum TC & Luas</li><li> M50 just minutes away</ul>"
      },
